Okay. Just, okay.

00:13:37.920 --> 00:13:40.160
Yeah, okay. And we're done.

00:13:40.220 --> 00:13:41.580
Some other, there's some other comedy though.

00:13:41.740 --> 00:13:45.040
No, there's some other comedy in the, like, in the battle commands of some of the fights

